Package: lumo-theme
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lumo OS Team <salom600@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: papirus-icon-theme, fonts-inter, fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-ui-core, fonts-noto-color-emoji
Recommends: lumo-defaults
Description: Lumo OS theme, wallpapers and branding
 Design system for Lumo OS: aurora wallpapers, GTK CSS theme, Lumo Bar CSS,
 palette, logo assets and the shared Python style helper used by all Lumo
 applications. Part of Lumo OS, a Debian 13 based ultra-light distribution.
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/salom600/lumo-os
